config PCIE_DW_ROCKCHIP
	bool "Rockchip DesignWare PCIe host controller"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_ROCKCHIP_RK3588_PCIE_ENABLED
	depends on ARM64
	depends on CLOCK_CONTROL
	select RESET
	select PCIE_DW
	help
	  Enable the DesignWare PCIe Root Complex driver for Rockchip RK3588
	  SoCs. The driver handles configuration space access, outbound iATU
	  windows, BAR allocation, endpoint enumeration and MSI through the
	  GICv3 ITS; legacy INTx is not supported. Only the pcie2x1l2
	  controller is supported for direct power-on (clocks, resets,
	  ComboPHY0, PERST#); other controllers need firmware bring-up and the
	  rockchip,firmware-initialized devicetree property. pcie3x4 support is
	  a follow-up.
